This directory is `mambalibs`, and it is empty on purpose.

`[tool.maturin] python-source = "python"` makes it the wheel's package root,
so the extension installs as `mambalibs/array.abi3.so`. There is no
`__init__.py`: `mambalibs` is a PEP 420 namespace package, so the later kit
wheels can install into the same directory in one environment.

Git tracks files, not directories, so this file is what keeps the directory
in the tree.
